{"seq":3,"slug":"account-hierarchy-ownership","title":"账户层级与归属","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/double-entry-ledger-platform/account-chart-model/account-hierarchy-ownership","wordCount":1889,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"账户层级与归属\">账户层级与归属</h1><p>一个账户回答了&quot;钱存在哪&quot;，但没回答&quot;这钱属于谁、谁能看、汇总到哪一层&quot;。这两个问题在生产系统里各自对应一类真实事故：归属不清导致 A 商户看到了 B 商户的余额（越权查询）；层级不清导致总账科目余额与明细账户汇总对不上（报表对不上）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-归属与层级是两个正交的结构\">核心概念：归属与层级是两个正交的结构</h2><p>一个账户回答了&quot;钱存在哪&quot;，但没回答&quot;这钱属于谁、谁能看、汇总到哪一层&quot;。这两个问题在生产系统里各自对应一类真实事故：归属不清导致 A 商户看到了 B 商户的余额（越权查询）；层级不清导致总账科目余额与明细账户汇总对不上（报表对不上）。</p>\n<p><strong>归属</strong>是账户与主体之间的多对一关系（一个主体对应若干账户），表达&quot;这钱归谁&quot;；<strong>层级</strong>是账户与账户之间的树形关系，表达&quot;这些账户如何汇总&quot;。两者正交：同一个归属下的账户可以分布在不同的层级节点上，同一个层级节点也可以聚合多个归属的账户。把两者混在一个字段里（比如用编码的前缀同时表达归属和层级）是常见的设计错误，会让&quot;组织调整&quot;必须改编码，从而波及历史数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归属-账户必然属于一个主体\">归属：账户必然属于一个主体</h2><h3 id=\"owner_type-决定四件事\">owner_type 决定四件事</h3><p>账户归属由 <code>(owner_type, owner_id)</code> 二元组表达。表面上这只是两个字段，实际上它决定了三件事：唯一性约束的粒度、查询的隔离边界、以及权限检查的入口。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>owner_type</th>\n<th>owner_id 含义</th>\n<th>数量级</th>\n<th>典型科目</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>USER</td>\n<td>用户 ID</td>\n<td>亿级</td>\n<td>用户钱包余额（负债）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MERCHANT</td>\n<td>商户 ID</td>\n<td>万~百万级</td>\n<td>应付商户款（负债）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PLATFORM</td>\n<td>固定标识（如 <code>PLATFORM_SELF</code>）</td>\n<td>个位数</td>\n<td>手续费收入、自有资金</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CHANNEL</td>\n<td>渠道标识（如 <code>PSP_STRIPE</code>）</td>\n<td>十~百级</td>\n<td>渠道在途、渠道成本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的存在意义是：<strong>唯一索引建立在归属之上</strong>，同一科目下同一主体同一币种只能有一个账户（见 <a href=\"multi-currency-account-balance\">多币种账户与余额</a> 中的 <code>uq_account_owner</code>）。如果只对 <code>account_id</code> 建唯一约束而不对归属建约束，就会出现同一商户重复开户的问题。</p>\n<p><code>owner_type</code> 的另一个作用是<strong>决定账户是否允许负余额</strong>。平台内部账户天然可以透支（清算在途户在清算完成前就是负的，它代表&quot;已确认但未到账&quot;），用户钱包和商户应付户则不应为负。把这个规则编码在开户模板里，比在每个业务点判断可靠：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE account_template (&#10;  template_id     VARCHAR(32) PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  coa_code        VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL REFERENCES chart_of_accounts(code),&#10;  owner_type      VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,&#10;  allow_negative  BOOLEAN     NOT NULL,&#10;  balance_dims    TEXT[]      NOT NULL  -- 该模板需要维护哪些余额维度&#10;);&#10;&#10;INSERT INTO account_template VALUES&#10;  (&#39;TPL_USER_WALLET&#39;,  &#39;2002&#39;, &#39;USER&#39;,     FALSE, &#39;{posted,frozen}&#39;),&#10;  (&#39;TPL_MERCHANT_PAY&#39;, &#39;2001&#39;, &#39;MERCHANT&#39;, FALSE, &#39;{posted,frozen}&#39;),&#10;  (&#39;TPL_CHANNEL_INFLT&#39;,&#39;1003&#39;, &#39;CHANNEL&#39;,  TRUE,  &#39;{posted}&#39;),&#10;  (&#39;TPL_PLATFORM_FEE&#39;, &#39;4001&#39;, &#39;PLATFORM&#39;, FALSE, &#39;{posted}&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> account_template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  template_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  coa_code        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chart_of_accounts(code),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  owner_type      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  allow_negative  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  balance_dims    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- 该模板需要维护哪些余额维度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_template </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'TPL_USER_WALLET'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2002'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'USER'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     FALSE, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{posted,frozen}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'TPL_MERCHANT_PAY'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2001'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'MERCHANT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, FALSE, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{posted,frozen}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'TPL_CHANNEL_INFLT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1003'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CHANNEL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  TRUE,  </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{posted}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'TPL_PLATFORM_FEE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'4001'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PLATFORM'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, FALSE, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{posted}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>用模板开户把&quot;这个类型的账户应该长什么样&quot;集中在一处，新增账户类型时不需要改开户逻辑。<code>balance_dims</code> 字段让余额维护按需进行——不追踪冻结的账户不必维护 <code>frozen</code> 列，避免无意义的写入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"层级-父子账户与汇总关系\">层级：父子账户与汇总关系</h2><h3 id=\"两层层级不要混用\">两层层级不要混用</h3><p>科目树（chart of accounts）本身就是一层层级，它表达&quot;科目之间的会计归集关系&quot;：<code>1001.01 银行存款-招行</code> 汇总到 <code>1001 银行存款</code>。但工程上还常需要第二层层级：<strong>账户之间的从属关系</strong>，比如一个集团下多个子公司各自的银行账户汇总成一个&quot;集团银行存款&quot;视图。</p>\n<p>这两层层级不要混用。区别在于变更频率与语义：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级类型</th>\n<th>表达关系</th>\n<th>变更频率</th>\n<th>存储位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>科目树</td>\n<td>会计归集（相同要素内）</td>\n<td>低（季度/年度调整）</td>\n<td><code>chart_of_accounts.parent_code</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账户从属</td>\n<td>组织归属（主体之间）</td>\n<td>中（组织调整时）</td>\n<td><code>account.parent_account_id</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>混用的代价是：一旦某集团把子公司 A 划给另一个事业部，需要同时动科目树和账户树，而科目树上的历史分录引用不能改。分开存之后，账户从属关系可以独立调整，历史分录完全不受影响。</p>\n<p>账户树还有一个隐藏的一致性约束：<strong>子账户的币种必须与父账户兼容</strong>。如果父账户是 CNY 汇总视图，把 USD 子账户挂进去会让汇总失去意义。实务做法是父账户不存余额，只作为分组节点存在，汇总值时按 <code>(parent, currency)</code> 分开算，而不是把不同币种加在一起。</p>\n<h3 id=\"递归汇总与重复计数\">递归汇总与重复计数</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 按账户树汇总某一节点的原币余额，按币种分组，不做跨币种相加&#10;WITH RECURSIVE subtree AS (&#10;  SELECT account_id, account_id AS root_id&#10;    FROM account WHERE account_id = &#39;ACC_GROUP_ACME_BANK&#39;&#10;  UNION ALL&#10;  SELECT a.account_id, s.root_id&#10;    FROM account a JOIN subtree s ON a.parent_account_id = s.account_id&#10;)&#10;SELECT a.currency,&#10;       SUM(b.posted_orig) AS total_orig,&#10;       COUNT(*)           AS account_count&#10;  FROM subtree s&#10;  JOIN account a         ON a.account_id = s.account_id&#10;  JOIN account_balance b ON b.account_id = a.account_id&#10; WHERE a.is_summary_node = FALSE   -- 汇总节点自身不持余额，避免重复计数&#10; GROUP BY a.currency;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 按账户树汇总某一节点的原币余额，按币种分组，不做跨币种相加</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> RECURSIVE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subtree </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_id, account_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> root_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ACC_GROUP_ACME_BANK'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">root_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subtree s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">parent_account_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">posted_orig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_orig,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subtree s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account a         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_balance b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">is_summary_node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FALSE   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 汇总节点自身不持余额，避免重复计数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>is_summary_node = FALSE</code> 这个条件防的是<strong>重复计数</strong>：如果父节点自己也维护余额（等于其子树之和），那么递归汇总时父子都会被统计，金额翻倍。让汇总节点不持余额是消除这类 bug 最简单的手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归属与层级共同决定权限边界\">归属与层级共同决定权限边界</h2><h3 id=\"归属过滤必须注入-sql\">归属过滤必须注入 SQL</h3><p>账户查询的权限检查应当有且只有一个入口，否则每个新加的报表接口都是一次越权机会。推荐的模型是&quot;账户可见性由归属决定，归属检查在数据访问层强制&quot;：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Q[查询请求] --&gt; A{请求主体类型}&#10;  A --&gt;|商户| B[限定 owner_id = 本商户]&#10;  A --&gt;|用户| C[限定 owner_id = 本用户]&#10;  A --&gt;|平台运营| D{是否有跨主体权限}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[限定 owner_type 与科目范围]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[拒绝]&#10;  B --&gt; G[SQL 层强制注入 WHERE]&#10;  C --&gt; G&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[返回结果]\">graph TD\n  Q[查询请求] --&gt; A{请求主体类型}\n  A --&gt;|商户| B[限定 owner_id = 本商户]\n  A --&gt;|用户| C[限定 owner_id = 本用户]\n  A --&gt;|平台运营| D{是否有跨主体权限}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[限定 owner_type 与科目范围]\n  D --&gt;|否| F[拒绝]\n  B --&gt; G[SQL 层强制注入 WHERE]\n  C --&gt; G\n  E --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[返回结果]</pre><p>关键在于 <code>G</code> 这一步：归属过滤必须注入到 SQL 里，而不是在应用层&quot;查出来再过滤&quot;。后者的问题是分页会先被权限过滤破坏（第一页十条过滤后只剩三条），而且任何一处忘记过滤就是数据泄露。用一个共享的查询构造器强制注入 <code>owner_id</code> 条件是可靠的做法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 数据访问层统一入口：owner 条件不可省略，省略即编译/构造失败&#10;SELECT b.account_id, a.currency, b.posted_orig, b.frozen_orig&#10;  FROM account a JOIN account_balance b USING (account_id)&#10; WHERE a.owner_type = :viewer_type&#10;   AND a.owner_id   = :viewer_id          -- 由会话推导，不接受请求参数&#10;   AND a.coa_code LIKE :coa_prefix&#10; ORDER BY b.account_id&#10; LIMIT :page_size;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 数据访问层统一入口：owner 条件不可省略，省略即编译/构造失败</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">posted_orig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">frozen_orig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_balance b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (account_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">owner_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :viewer_type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">owner_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :viewer_id          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 由会话推导，不接受请求参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">coa_code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIKE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :coa_prefix</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :page_size;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>:viewer_id</code> 从会话身份推导而非请求参数，这一点是安全边界的核心。只要它来自请求体或查询串，越权就只是一个参数值的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"账户生命周期-开户-冻结-关户\">账户生命周期：开户、冻结、关户</h2><h3 id=\"三种状态变化与不可删除原则\">三种状态变化与不可删除原则</h3><p>账户不是一次创建永久有效。至少三种状态变化需要在模型里表达：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>冻结（suspended）</strong>：账户存在但禁止新分录，用于风控命中、商户违规。注意冻结与余额冻结是两件事——前者禁写，后者占用资金。</li>\n<li><strong>关户（closed）</strong>：不再使用，但历史分录必须保留，因此账户记录<strong>不能删除</strong>，只能置状态。这与账本的不可变原则一致。</li>\n<li><strong>迁移（migrated）</strong>：账户归属变更（商户主体合并），历史分录仍指向旧账户，新分录走新账户，通过 <code>migrated_to</code> 字段串联。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>任何一种&quot;删除账户&quot;的冲动都要拒绝：科目余额表的历史期间会因为账户消失而无法复现，审计证据链断裂。正确的做法是状态位加查询过滤，见 <a href=\"../ledger-query-period-close/ledger-audit-retention-report\">审计留存与报表</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"状态字段与过账前置检查\">状态字段与过账前置检查</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"ALTER TABLE account&#10;  ADD COLUMN status      VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;ACTIVE&#39;&#10;        CHECK (status IN (&#39;ACTIVE&#39;,&#39;SUSPENDED&#39;,&#39;CLOSED&#39;)),&#10;  ADD COLUMN migrated_to VARCHAR(40) REFERENCES account(account_id),&#10;  ADD COLUMN closed_at   TIMESTAMPTZ;&#10;&#10;-- 过账前置检查：SUSPENDED / CLOSED 一律拒绝新分录&#10;-- 该检查与分录插入在同一个事务里执行，避免检查通过后被并发冻结\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ADD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> COLUMN </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ACTIVE'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ACTIVE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SUSPENDED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CLOSED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ADD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> COLUMN migrated_to </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account(account_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ADD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> COLUMN closed_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 过账前置检查：SUSPENDED / CLOSED 一律拒绝新分录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 该检查与分录插入在同一个事务里执行，避免检查通过后被并发冻结</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>归属与层级是账户模型的两个结构性问题，处理得当能让权限与报表都变得简单。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>(coa_code, owner_type, owner_id, currency)</code> 构成账户唯一键</strong>，防止并发开户产生重复账户。</li>\n<li><strong><code>owner_type</code> 决定是否允许负余额</strong>，把规则编码在开户模板里而非散落在业务点。</li>\n<li><strong>科目树与账户从属树分开存</strong>，前者管会计归集，后者管组织归属，变更频率不同。</li>\n<li><strong>汇总节点不持余额</strong>，递归汇总时只统计叶子账户，从结构上消除重复计数。</li>\n<li><strong>归属过滤强制注入 SQL</strong>，<code>viewer_id</code> 由会话推导；账户不删除只置状态，保住历史期间的可复现性。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>账户模型到此完成。接下来进入第二章：往这些账户上写第一批分录，见 <a href=\"../double-entry-posting/debit-credit-balanced-entry\">借贷分录与平衡校验</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"账户层级与归属","id":"账户层级与归属"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：归属与层级是两个正交的结构","id":"核心概念-归属与层级是两个正交的结构"},{"level":2,"text":"归属：账户必然属于一个主体","id":"归属-账户必然属于一个主体"},{"level":3,"text":"owner_type 决定四件事","id":"owner_type-决定四件事"},{"level":2,"text":"层级：父子账户与汇总关系","id":"层级-父子账户与汇总关系"},{"level":3,"text":"两层层级不要混用","id":"两层层级不要混用"},{"level":3,"text":"递归汇总与重复计数","id":"递归汇总与重复计数"},{"level":2,"text":"归属与层级共同决定权限边界","id":"归属与层级共同决定权限边界"},{"level":3,"text":"归属过滤必须注入 SQL","id":"归属过滤必须注入-sql"},{"level":2,"text":"账户生命周期：开户、冻结、关户","id":"账户生命周期-开户-冻结-关户"},{"level":3,"text":"三种状态变化与不可删除原则","id":"三种状态变化与不可删除原则"},{"level":3,"text":"状态字段与过账前置检查","id":"状态字段与过账前置检查"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多币种账户与余额","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/double-entry-ledger-platform/account-chart-model/multi-currency-account-balance"},"next":{"title":"借贷分录与平衡校验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/double-entry-ledger-platform/double-entry-posting/debit-credit-balanced-entry"}}